		line=1553,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"After we manage to pacify the Koubukan warriors at the Sworn Blades, we head to school.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"We decided to move the blades we keep stored at home to the headquarters for the time being.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"At any rate, hastily lashing out will only play straight into\nOkonogi's hands.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Maki and his crew are nearing the end of their patience.”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Seems like announcing the ban really did its job.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“At this point, it's not even logic that's driving them.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"“It's not about winning or losing─it's about the pride of what it means to be a warrior.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"This is the Koubukan's assertion.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's not like I don't get where they're coming from.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Really, I'd like nothing more than to rush the Imperial Palace right this second.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"Hotori’s hand unconsciously drifts towards her hip, but she grasps nothing but air.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"The acting chairman made a show of being the first to disarm herself in order to set an example for Maki.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"Of course, this will only work as a stopgap measure.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"I also left my self-defense sidearm back at headquarters.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"Being completely unarmed is strangely disquieting, as though I've lost a precious part of my own body.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We have to rescue Father, and soon.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm sure he'll be able to hold the Blades together.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're doing a perfectly fine job yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"I reach over to pat Hotori on the head.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Thanks...”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's nothing.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"Right as we set foot into the courtyard, the bell signalling lunch break rings.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Whew, I was just getting hungry.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's head straight to the cafeteria. Everyone should already be there.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"Come to think of it, I never got the chance to have breakfast.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hmm? What's the matter?”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori, you made breakfast today, right?”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh? Yeah, I guess I did.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We didn't have any time to eat, so I left it back at headquarters.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I even made miso-glazed tofu, you know.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you serious...?”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"That's the second worst news I've heard all day.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"Hotori's miso-glazed tofu is truly one of a kind for its splendid balance of citrusy tartness.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"To be sure, Sworn Blades work absolutely ought to take priority, but I can't help but feel disappointed all the same.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I-I'll make it for you tomorrow as well, so don't look so sad.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Will you really!?”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I will, I will. No need to make such a big deal out of it.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll look forward to it!”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"We arrive at the cafeteria.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"I can feel every single Republican's eyes turn to face our direction.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"The warriors were responsible for the explosions, according to the news reports at least.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"I'll try to put it out of my mind.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"After we serve ourselves at the buffet, we head over to where everyone else is sitting.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Heya. Heard y'all were awfully busy today.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Yeah, yeah...”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Welcome back, you two.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, thanks.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"I sit down next to Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I figured you'd be tired, so I got you both some good ol' meat.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“You know you want it, you know you want it!”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"She heaps an extra-large serving of steak on our plates.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"Steak is a Republican-style meal.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"Helping herself to it is a bold move only available to Shino and her mixed ancestry.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Well? Ain'tcha glad I'm mixed? Ahahahaha!”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“A simple meal is more than enough for a warrior.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm perfectly happy to not bite off any more than I can chew.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“No wonder those explosions were so weaksauce if you're saying stuff like that all the time.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“*Cough!*”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"Hotori spews out a mouthful of hot tea.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Now listen here. We had nothing to do with that.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Just some Republican humor, my friend.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Here. You eat up too, Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I've already had more than enough...”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"Akari mutters with a thousand-yard stare.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hmm? Is that a lonely cherry-on-top I spy?!”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Don't mind if I do!”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"She swipes and gobbles up the bright red cherry Akari was saving for last.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Aaaaahhh! Not again!”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're totally doing this on purpose, aren't you?”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"Ahh, what a lively sight.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"Perhaps it's because my everyday is a desperate life-and-death struggle that these precious moments feel like stepping into another world.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"I wonder if Shino feels the same way, having to wade into the cutthroat world of business whenever she leaves the school campus.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Shino, give it a rest.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The Republicans are giving us the stink eye enough as it is.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hmm, now that you mention it...”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"Shino pipes down at once.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Oh, yeah. You hear about the reparations?”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Seems like the Republic is using the bombing as a pretext to put the screws to the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That's news to me.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Naturally, the chancellor is gonna cough it up, and you can probably guess where the money's coming from.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Taxes.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“He's gonna take it from the people?”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“That's how it goes.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“It’s only gonna get worse for the warriors from here on out, so don't let your guard down.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Even your neighbors might start snitching on you.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's only natural the citizens would be angry. All we can do is protect ourselves.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“By the way, our good chancellor is counting on another unscrupulous revenue stream.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"Shino looks meaningfully at me and Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“It's the blades he's confiscating from the warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What do you mean?”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Lately, blades have been going for a lot of money at art auctions in the Republic.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Even a regular blade'll go for a million at least. And if it's an inscribed keenblade we're talking about, it'll easily fetch upwards of a hundred mil.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“That's why the chancellor’s so keen to start snatching up blades.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Money doesn't grow on trees, you know, so he'll take anything he can exchange for dough.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Well, he has other goals in mind, too, of course.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"She doesn't have to tell us that he's also intending to provoke the warriors.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“To think that our blades are being sold off like that...”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"Hotori squeezes her eyes tightly shut.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"Teardrops begin pooling on her long eyelashes.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“As if Republicans could ever understand the true value of a blade.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“They sure do fetch a pretty penny though, you know?”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's not a matter of price.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I know, dude. It's just a joke...”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"Shino slumps her shoulders and raises her palms in a familiar Republican-style gesture.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“How do you do, friends?”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Would you mind teaching me a little bit about Imperial blades as well?”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"Elsa glides towards us, holding a tray laden with only a single cup of black tea.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"She meets my gaze head-on.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"I barely managed to escape with my life in our battle just the other day.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"I sure hope this doesn't turn into trouble.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hey, now, Elsa. You need to be eating properly!”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Shino, since when did you turn into my mother?”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“For your information, I'm on a diet.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Good for you. You could definitely stand to lose some of that Republican upper body fat.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“If only it were that easy. It even hurts to move around in combat sometimes.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Why don't you just wrap them up? Seeing them jiggling around like that pisses me off.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Wha─”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"Hotori's out for blood because of the events regarding our blades.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"I involuntarily shrink back from the frightening direction the conversation is headed.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"A man must choose his battles wisely.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“A-Anyways, Elsa, have a seat.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Why, thank you.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"With clear deliberate intent, Elsa elegantly sits down right beside me.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(Huh!?)”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(Ngh...)”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Having to deal with girls like these two all day must be exhausting, hmm?”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“They might not look like it, but they're actually quite understanding.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Spoken like a true gentleman...”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“How long has it been, Tokita-kun? Since our encounter that fateful night?”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"She's talking about the night Akari was abducted.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It looks like I was right to bet on your conscience.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What's this about?”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Our little secret.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"Elsa smirkingly brushes her hair behind her shoulder, tickling my nostrils with a floral fragrance.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"A seemingly innocent and girlish gesture like that would certainly be enough to set a typical adolescent man's heart aflutter.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"Unfortunately for her, those thoughts are the last thing on my mind right now.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You were talking about blades earlier, is that right?”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“My consolances for the government's announcement this morning.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Condolences.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Ah yes, my condolences.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"She corrects herself, never breaking her perfect smile.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm not too happy about it myself, you know?”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It's much easier to identify a warrior when they're wearing their blade, after all.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Gee, my condolences.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So, what business do you have with us?”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"Elsa leisurely sips at her tea.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"She elegantly sets down her cup before finally replying to\nAkari's question.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Would you tell me about the meaning of 'fealty?'”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Surely the commander-in-chief of the warriors can give me the right answer, yes?”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What's it to you?”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Nothing work-related, of course. We ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"are",
{"/font"},
" at school, after all, so won’t you simply indulge my intellectual curiosity?”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I interpreted it as referring to 'loyalty in carrying out your\nduty,' but it seems...”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Not just any duty. To your lord.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Warriors dedicate their lives to serving as their lord's blade.”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Then if you were ordered to die, you would just accept that?”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori & Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course.” “I definitely wouldn't.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“How can your opinions be split on this?”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Everyone has their own way of thinking about fealty.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You can't be serious...”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"She seems rather let down by this response.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's run down the usual questions.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Suppose your lord gives an unwise command.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Is it a warrior's fealty to unconditionally obey, or to set them straight?”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“To obey.”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I would set them straight.”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You're disloyal.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Guiding your lord to the right path is one form of fealty.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"We've had this exchange countless times.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What would you do, Elsa?”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I would...”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Set them straight.”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"Elsa answers with a vaguely brooding expression.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"Maybe that question hit close to home.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Sorry if this seems confusing, but there's no one strict definition for fealty.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“All that's important is to always hold yourself accountable to your own fealty.”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“So in the end, it's entirely up to the individual?”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That does nothing to serve as a model for how to live.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“No, you don't understand.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Warriors need to be ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"desperate",
{"/font"},
" about upholding their fealty.”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That means constantly asking questions about the depth of your resolve. And being willing to bet on that answer with your own life.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“So... To embody fealty is to stake your life on pursuing your ideal self?”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That's a reasonable way to think about it.”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“So that's why warriors glorify suicide so much.”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Um... seppuku, was it called?”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“There is a tendency by some to glorify it, but I'm not one of them.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you proactively seek out death, it does certainly seem like you staked your life on your fealty.”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But warriors exist only to win battles for our lords. In no scenario could it ever be better to die than to live.”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You only deserve praise for doing your duty, for surviving each battle and supporting your lord to the very end.”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I understand dying in the course of upholding your fealty, but dying ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"in order",
{"/font"},
" to uphold your fealty is putting the cart before the horse.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“In other words, you shouldn't ever seek out death as your goal.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"Akari murmurs out loud.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"When I first met her in Tenkyo, she lived with death as her goal.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"And I'm the one who set her straight.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Death is a seductive idea. It can lead anyone astray.”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It's all too easy to forget your ideals and start chasing after superficial things instead, huh...?”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"Elsa mutters, nodding keenly to my words.",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“This conversation suuure makes you think, doesn't it?”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Whaddaya think, Elsa? You like the warriors' integrity?”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“A real far cry from the Republican Army, am I right?”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"Elsa's eyebrows twitch upward.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh, Shino. I see you're flying your Imperial colors today.”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Remind me, just how much hardware did we order from you again?”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Oh, y'all were planning to pay for that? I thought that was just the army asking for its due.”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Is that any way to talk about your biggest client?”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“No, no, thanks for your patronage, truly!”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"Based on the ripples in my miso soup, it seems like a fierce battle of footwork is taking place right under the table.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"It's nice to see they get along well.",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Well, I'll admit that the warriors are indeed quite noble.”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But to me, they seem more tragic than anything else.”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What makes you think that?”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“As soon as you're born a warrior, you’re incapable of leading any other sort of life.”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The qualifications for becoming a warrior are entirely hereditary, so there's never any new blood, never any new ideas.”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I suppose an institution like this is the natural result of a society that hasn't had any social mobility for two thousand years.”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Indeed, the philosophy you've developed is beautiful.”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But to me, it seems like you've just gotten used to dragging around the same old worldviews of your ancestors like a ball and chain.”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“In the Republic, we'd call this ≪Stockholm Syndrome...≫”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Do you mean to insult us?”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Just my honest impressions as an outsider looking in.”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Do you all not yearn to live free?”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If I were ever to be reborn, I would want it to be as a warrior.”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Same here.”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I see. I suppose I have nothing to say to that.”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You've never known anything else, after all...”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			{
"Her voice trails off as an emotion resembling pity crosses her delicate features.",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			{
"I don't want to be pitied by a foreigner like her.",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We in the Republic are going to reshape the Empire so that future generations can at least live more freely.”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We'll introduce democracy, dissolve hereditary occupations, and grant people the freedom to choose their own calling.”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“May your children never have to live so tragically, chasing after fealty with their own lives...”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Oh no... Soujin and I don't have that kind of...”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I never said anything about children between you two!”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Ahahahahaha! I'm dying! Nice one, Hotori!”",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"Shino doubles over as she repeatedly slaps the table.",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh, give it a rest, Shino.”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Freedom is an unalienable right all human beings are endowed with.”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm sure you'll come to understand someday just how unfortunate it is to live without it.”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Give it another ten years, and you'll be thanking us.”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Must be real nice to be able to say that with a straight face.”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Playing at being a savior and all.”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But at the end of the day, all you're doing is subjugating others with violence and forcing your own values onto them.”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It sometimes takes a tough glove to discipline a misbehaving child.”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Tough love. Who needs gloves to discipline a child?”",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Right. Tough love.”",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I agree with Miyaguni. You can mind your own business.”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We'll decide the future of our country ourselves.”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh my, you make it sound like you want to stage a coup\nd'etat.”",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			{
"Elsa replies with a composed smile.",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			{
"Hotori stares back at her with the same dead-serious expression.",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			{
"It's as though she's saying, “Feel free to interpret it that way.”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Doesn't the Republic recognize the right to freedom of speech?”",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We sure do, but freedom of speech still involves having to take responsibility for what you say.”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You wouldn't be confessing to seditious conspiracy to me, of all people, would you?”",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You can be charged on a statement alone?”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We have ways of finding out all sorts of things after we take you in.”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I see.”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But you won't do that.”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I wonder about that... I do hope I can live up to your expectations.”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I've always thought of you as an upstanding soldier. Am I mistaken?”",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But of course, Tokita-kun.”",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			{
"Elsa brings her cup to her lips and grimaces slightly at the taste.",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			{
"Her tea must be cold and bitter by now.",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Have you ever thought about it, I wonder?”",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What it means to be born purely for the sake of murdering others?”",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I wasn't born to kill. I was born simply to protect the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Even as a means to the end of protecting your country, it\ndoesn't change the fact that you're a murderer.”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			{
"Elsa coolly delivers her rebuttal with an unperturbed expression.",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Once we remake this country, your life will belong to you alone, even if you're born into a family of warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Wouldn't it be wonderful if everyone could freely choose their own path in life?”",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You could fully dedicate yourself to your flowers, and Inou-san wouldn't have to disguise herself when she sings.”",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Well?”",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			{
"My heart leaps up in my chest at her words.",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			{
"Elsa knows all about Natsumi.",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			{
"Only a handful of people know the famous singer\nNatsumi's secret identity.",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			{
{"font", size=53},
"There's only the warriors of the Sworn Blades, Mutsumi-san, the manager, and Shino, who was responsible for bringing Natsumi to the world in the first place.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[279]={
			{
"Is she intending to interrogate us about that?",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			{
"The sudden ringing of a cell phone breaks the tension.",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh dear, please excuse me.”",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			{
"Elsa takes out her cell phone.",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			{
"The netsuke dangling from her phone catches my eye.",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			{
"I've seen it somewhere before.",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			{
"But I can't remember where...",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Where did you get that netsuke?”",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Huh? This here?”",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It was a gift from someone, so I couldn't say where it's from.”",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I've seen it before, too.”",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			{
"Hotori inexplicably mutters as she stares at the charm.",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Where?”",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Er, well...”",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Everyone in your family had one with the same design.”",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			{
"I understand why Hotori was hesitant to say it.",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oh, so that's how it is.”",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			{
"No wonder I couldn't remember.",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh, Tokita-kun's family...”",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			{
"Elsa murmurs, lowering her gaze.",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			{
"She must have picked up on the fact that my family is no longer with us.",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I've been summoned, so I'll have to take my leave for now.”",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			{
"Elsa takes her tray and stands up.",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Thank you for your time. I'm glad we got to have such a meaningful discussion today.”",
			},
		},
		[304]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I can't admit it publicly because of my position, but I'm not opposed to your ideas about fealty.”",
			},
		},
		[305]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I think I can understand why you warriors are always walking around with your heads held high.”",
			},
		},
		[306]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Then it was worth talking to you.”",
			},
		},
		[307]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“In that case, I have very high hopes that the warriors might behave themselves a little better from now on.”",
			},
		},
		[308]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Okay?”",
			},
		},
		[309]={
			{
"Elsa departs after gracing us with one last perfect smile.",
			},
		},
		[310]={
			{
"After lunch, I call out to Hotori, who seems lost in thought.",
			},
		},
		[311]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you letting what Elsa said get to you?”",
			},
		},
		[312]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I wouldn't say that. I'm just thinking, is all.”",
			},
		},
		[313]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Warriors really aren't needed in times of peace, are they?”",
			},
		},
		[314]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I guess not.”",
			},
		},
		[315]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We're born to protect the country, but unless we're at war,\nthere's no place for us. Doesn't that make you feel a little lonely?”",
			},
		},
		[316]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“When it comes down to it, the only way for us to prove our worth is by hurting others.”",
			},
		},
		[317]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“In the end, isn't the only reason we practice blade arts to get better and better at hurting people?”",
			},
		},
		[318]={
			{
"Hotori asks with a troubled smile.",
			},
		},
		[319]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even if that's the case, it's not like we're any different from physicians, or firefighters, or coffinmakers.”",
			},
		},
		[320]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In a way, couldn't you think of us as the Empire's firefighters?”",
			},
		},
		[321]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It would be great if there weren't ever any fires, but it'd be a bigger problem if firefighters aren't around when they're needed.”",
			},
		},
		[322]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Oh, that’s a good point.”",
			},
		},
		[323]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What do you mean? Isn't it obvious?”",
			},
		},
		[324]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And besides, I've never once thought of blade arts as being a sad thing.”",
			},
		},
		[325]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“There could be no greater happiness than being able to protect what's most dear to you with your own strength.”",
			},
		},
		[326]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The thought of entrusting their fate to anyone else's hands... I couldn't bear it.”",
			},
		},
		[327]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No matter what the outcome might be...”",
			},
		},
		[328]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll always take pride in being able to fight for myself.”",
			},
		},
		[329]={
			{
"─In being able to protect what's dear to me.",
			},
		},
		[330]={
			{
"People might be at their most vicious and most cruel when\nthey're fighting. But before any of that, they're at their most beautiful.",
			},
		},
		[331]={
			{
"It's a sight which evokes an exceedingly primitive, yet endlessly pure feeling found nowhere else.",
			},
		},
		[332]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I really like the way you think.”",
			},
		},
		[333]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It gives me courage.”",
			},
		},
		[334]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's good to hear.”",
			},
		},
		[335]={
			{
"I reassuringly pat Hotori on the head.",
			},
		},
		[336]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Now, let's head to our next class.”",
			},
		},
		[337]={
			{
"Hotori is straightforward to a fault.",
			},
		},
		[338]={
			{
"But being so straightforward comes with its own share of problems.",
			},
		},
		[339]={
			{
"I have to support Hotori with everything I have... so she\ndoesn't fall apart.",
			},
		},
		[340]={
			{
"This is my duty. It's the only thing that I can do to repay all her kindness towards me.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
